WEBVTT

00:01.410 --> 00:06.920
H-Hey, Jasper. Do I really
have to be here in person?

00:06.920 --> 00:08.750
You'll be fine, young man.

00:09.250 --> 00:12.550
I know you're worried about
being suspected as a phony,

00:12.550 --> 00:14.800
but you'll be fine with me here.

00:15.840 --> 00:18.060
Look, it's Jasper!

00:18.060 --> 00:20.560
So that's the wealthy jade merchant.

00:20.560 --> 00:22.810
Who's the guy behind him?

00:22.810 --> 00:26.690
Welcome, Lord Jasper.
We're glad to see you.

00:26.690 --> 00:29.270
I'll call the Guild Master right away.

00:29.270 --> 00:30.940
You don't have to.

00:30.940 --> 00:33.700
I'm just accompanying him today.

00:33.700 --> 00:38.410
I see. So, what's your business here?

00:38.410 --> 00:43.710
Uh... I'd like to sell some
items I got in a dungeon.

00:43.710 --> 00:48.960
And then, I want to buy back
the items he sold.

00:48.960 --> 00:51.050
Understood.

00:51.050 --> 00:53.840
Then, may I have your guild card, please?

00:54.470 --> 00:55.840
Here you go...

00:55.840 --> 00:57.340
Thank you. I'll take it, then.

00:57.340 --> 01:01.100
Let's see... Your name is Ein.

01:01.100 --> 01:02.600
Your rank is...

01:02.600 --> 01:04.230
R-Rank F?

01:05.520 --> 01:07.230
And your job is...

01:07.230 --> 01:09.360
Appraiser?!

01:09.360 --> 01:12.990
An appraiser taking down
a monster is unbelievable.

01:12.990 --> 01:16.610
Lord Jasper. Are you sure that
he's not deceiving you?

01:16.610 --> 01:21.660
Man, I thought he was some Rare Class,
turns out he's a low commoner.

01:21.660 --> 01:25.000
And he was about to scam Jasper,
of all people. What a clown.

01:26.040 --> 01:30.090
Come on, young man. Time to
show them the truth.

01:33.380 --> 01:35.470
What?!

01:35.470 --> 01:38.890
What is this mountain of
rare items?!

01:38.890 --> 01:42.010
Look, isn't that the skull of
the Undead King?

01:42.010 --> 01:45.390
How is an Appraiser getting
the Boss Monster's item drops?

01:45.390 --> 01:50.190
Even if those are real,
he must've stolen those from someone!

01:50.190 --> 01:51.770
Of course.

01:51.770 --> 01:55.030
No way in hell a low commoner
could defeat one.

01:55.610 --> 01:59.030
This is why I hate
coming to the guild.

01:59.030 --> 02:03.830
I hate standing out. I also hate how
despised low commoners' jobs are.

02:05.910 --> 02:07.790
Silence, you shameless bunch!

02:08.580 --> 02:12.670
There's nothing more foolish
than judging a person just by their job.

02:12.670 --> 02:14.920
Isn't that person...

02:14.920 --> 02:18.930
The Royal Capital's Adventurer Guild's
Guild Master, Meegan!

02:21.050 --> 02:23.470
Well, boy.

02:23.470 --> 02:26.560
Some sharp eyes you got.

02:26.560 --> 02:28.890
Did she notice my prosthetic eye?

02:29.520 --> 02:32.020
What's the deal with her?

02:35.280 --> 02:38.150
She is the guild master.

02:38.150 --> 02:43.160
Upon appraising these items
with Eye of Truth,

02:43.910 --> 02:46.410
I can confirm that
all of them are genuine!

02:47.660 --> 02:49.290
Do you understand now?

02:49.290 --> 02:54.250
He is a strong warrior that defeats
monsters with his own power.

02:54.250 --> 02:56.300
And I, Jasper, can guarantee that.

02:56.300 --> 02:58.420
S-Sir Ein!

02:58.420 --> 03:03.050
I deeply apologize for my rudeness!

03:03.050 --> 03:07.350
I'll give her an earful
so please let this one slide.

03:07.350 --> 03:10.810
It's arrogant to judge someone
just by their job.

03:10.810 --> 03:15.320
While fate might be decided from birth,

03:15.320 --> 03:20.070
what makes life interesting is
those who break free from that.

03:24.070 --> 03:25.990
Hmm? What's wrong?

03:25.990 --> 03:27.330
Nothing.

03:27.330 --> 03:32.080
I just realized there are people
in the guild who think like you do.

03:32.580 --> 03:35.090
It makes me glad to be here!

03:36.090 --> 03:38.090
Nice.

03:38.090 --> 03:40.090
Your name is Ein, right?

03:40.920 --> 03:43.220
I like strong people!

03:43.220 --> 03:47.220
I'd love to have someone
like you in my guild.

03:47.220 --> 03:48.430
Huh?

03:48.430 --> 03:50.980
Well, just give it a thought.

03:50.980 --> 03:55.610
I have a feeling we'll be
seeing each other again soon.

03:56.610 --> 04:00.030
Then, Sir Ein, we will begin
the liquidation process.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.740
Please wait in the back room!

04:01.740 --> 04:02.490
Hold a moment!

04:03.410 --> 04:08.910
Young man. Hand over the rest of the items
from clearing that hidden dungeon.

04:08.910 --> 04:11.000
Huh?

04:11.620 --> 04:13.210
What?!

04:13.210 --> 04:16.670
Amazing! He actually cleared
a hidden dungeon?!

04:16.670 --> 04:18.750
Who are you really?!

04:18.750 --> 04:21.010
W-Wait...

04:21.010 --> 04:24.010
Give me a break!

04:27.640 --> 04:30.020
Ah, I'm beat...

04:30.020 --> 04:35.020
I hate being looked down upon,
but I also dislike being overly praised.

04:35.020 --> 04:37.310
It just feels off.

04:38.020 --> 04:41.650
Look, Ein. Isn't the moon
so beautiful tonight?

04:41.650 --> 04:43.780
Indeed, it is.

04:43.780 --> 04:46.160
Wait, what?!

04:46.160 --> 04:48.530
W-Why are you here, Yuri?

04:48.530 --> 04:51.950
Why are you distancing yourself?

04:51.950 --> 04:57.540
That's because our mister here got himself
all steamy after seeing your birthday suit.

04:57.540 --> 04:59.710
Steamy? Is it from the bath we're taking?

04:59.710 --> 05:01.000
Nope.

05:01.000 --> 05:04.130
Wait! Wait! Wait!
What are you two doing here?

05:04.130 --> 05:06.050
This is the men's bath!

05:06.050 --> 05:10.100
Aww. We're spirits, though.

05:10.100 --> 05:13.480
Why should we abide by human norms?

05:13.480 --> 05:15.810
Because this is a human bathhouse!

05:15.810 --> 05:20.820
Oh, my. Are you perhaps
getting embarrassed, Mister?

05:20.820 --> 05:24.320
Like, from thinking naughty things
upon seeing my sister, maybe?

05:24.320 --> 05:26.450
Of course I'm not...

05:32.290 --> 05:37.960
Looks like a half-human, half-spirit
baby is just a matter of time now!

05:38.210 --> 05:39.460
Hey, kid.

05:40.500 --> 05:44.380
You just looked at my daughter
with dirty eyes, didn't you?

05:44.380 --> 05:47.470
Whoa! Cover yourself, Ursula!

05:47.470 --> 05:51.220
You listen closely and well.
Yuri is my treasure.

05:51.220 --> 05:52.500
Lay a finger on her,

05:52.500 --> 05:55.980
and I'll blast you to the end of the earth
with ultimate magic!

05:56.480 --> 05:59.230
Please stop it, Mother!

05:59.230 --> 06:04.030
Don't stop me, Yuri! I'm eliminating
this vile pest for your sake!

06:04.030 --> 06:07.650
He's not a pest!
Ein is a wonderful person!

06:09.360 --> 06:11.740
Oh no, have you...

06:14.120 --> 06:15.750
You filthy brat...

06:15.750 --> 06:18.370
You better have your will
fully prepared.

06:18.370 --> 06:20.250
Is she serious?!

06:20.250 --> 06:22.380
No! Run, Ein! Run!

06:22.380 --> 06:24.420
Yay! Do it!

06:28.680 --> 06:31.510
Please give me a break...

06:31.510 --> 06:34.510
Fancy meeting you here, Einy.

06:34.510 --> 06:37.560
So you were resting here, Kurohime?

06:38.640 --> 06:41.520
It's been a while since I've seen
such a lively scene.

06:41.520 --> 06:45.280
Leaving Pina in your care
was the right choice.

06:45.280 --> 06:47.280
Thank you, Einy.

06:47.280 --> 06:50.780
Is Pina like a daughter to you?

06:51.660 --> 06:52.530
I suppose so.

06:52.530 --> 06:55.040
The guardians created Spirit Cores,

06:55.040 --> 06:58.120
and the personalities in it
are those children.

06:58.120 --> 07:01.670
So, in a way,
I'm her biological parent.

07:02.330 --> 07:05.050
That means, aside from Yuri and Pina,

07:05.050 --> 07:08.800
(Withered away)
there are six more of those lively ones, eh?

07:09.470 --> 07:10.550
No.

07:10.550 --> 07:12.300
Seven of them.

07:12.300 --> 07:16.350
What? Wasn't one of them said
to have withered away ages ago?

07:16.350 --> 07:21.390
Yes, but that doesn't mean that
the Spirit Core was completely destroyed.

07:21.390 --> 07:26.020
Does that mean that
that one spirit is still alive?

07:26.020 --> 07:28.030
Yes, most likely.

07:29.190 --> 07:32.280
Their eldest sister, Echidna,

07:32.280 --> 07:35.620
should be still alive somewhere
with her guardian.

07:35.620 --> 07:39.040
Although, Echidna herself
is still missing.

07:39.040 --> 07:43.040
We also don't know where the remaining
Yggdrasil dungeons are.

07:43.040 --> 07:45.960
That really is a serious problem.

07:46.500 --> 07:48.880
Are you feeling lost?

07:49.550 --> 07:51.630
Are you giving up the search?

07:54.970 --> 07:56.140
Not a chance.

07:56.680 --> 07:59.140
My goal hasn't changed.

07:59.140 --> 08:02.640
I want Yuri, my benefactor,
to be reunited with her family.

08:03.600 --> 08:06.900
And I'll do whatever it takes
to make that happen.

08:10.030 --> 08:11.990
It's neither your job nor your skill.

08:11.990 --> 08:15.780
You have something else special...

08:15.780 --> 08:17.200
...that draws people to you.

08:20.910 --> 08:23.710
A lot has happened yesterday,

08:23.710 --> 08:26.670
but I'll get back up today
to gather information!

08:27.540 --> 08:28.500
Good morning!

08:29.420 --> 08:32.670
'Sup, Ein. I came straight to find ya.

08:32.670 --> 08:33.930
Miss Meegan?

08:34.880 --> 08:36.680
Morning to you too, young man.

08:36.680 --> 08:40.140
The Guild Master personally came
to make a request to you.

08:40.140 --> 08:43.980
Why me? Wouldn't it be better
to ask the guild members?

08:43.980 --> 08:47.940
Thing is, you're the only one
I can entrust this to.

08:48.520 --> 08:50.480
Ever heard of Behemoth?

08:50.480 --> 08:52.690
No, never.

08:53.450 --> 08:57.740
It's one of the powerful ancient dragons
created by the Demon King Miktoran.

08:58.410 --> 09:02.330
It has disappeared since
the Demon King was sealed away.

09:02.870 --> 09:06.670
For some reason, it seems to
have resurfaced recently

09:06.670 --> 09:10.130
and it is attacking
passing merchants and their goods.

09:10.130 --> 09:13.130
My visit here is for no other reason.

09:13.130 --> 09:18.640
I'm here to formally request you to
take on the SS-rank Behemoth hunt.

09:19.890 --> 09:22.890
An SS-ranked... difficulty?

09:23.310 --> 09:26.310
It is a mission where
you could lose your life.

09:26.310 --> 09:30.440
We understand that you don't want
to be involved in the guild's business...

09:31.650 --> 09:33.940
Got it. I'll take the quest.

09:35.150 --> 09:37.160
You guys are in trouble, right?

09:39.490 --> 09:43.910
You have a strong heart
worthy of your power.

09:43.910 --> 09:47.040
As expected of a man I had faith in.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.130
Good grief.

09:50.130 --> 09:53.340
Do you not realize
how much you've grown?

09:53.340 --> 09:54.300
Ursula?

09:55.010 --> 09:58.050
Once again, we're counting on you, Ein.

09:58.800 --> 09:59.800
You got it.

10:05.100 --> 10:06.980
Man, it's scorching...

10:06.980 --> 10:10.770
Ursula, the Behemoth should be
around here, right?

10:10.770 --> 10:13.610
Yes. I've already appraised its location.

10:13.610 --> 10:18.740
It's an earth dragon that can absorb
magic and convert it into its own mana.

10:18.740 --> 10:23.990
It also fires air bullets, known as
Spiral Bullets, that tear through space.

10:23.990 --> 10:25.620
I see...

10:26.040 --> 10:27.660
Magic absorption, huh?

10:27.660 --> 10:30.880
I can only use my
sword and abilities, then.

10:30.880 --> 10:34.630
Behemoth burrows itself
in the sand during the day.

10:34.630 --> 10:37.510
First, you need to drag it
out of the sand.

10:37.510 --> 10:38.660
Got it.

10:38.660 --> 10:40.640
Nova Strike!

10:57.030 --> 10:58.110
Who was that?

10:59.370 --> 11:02.960
Who dares disturb my slumber?

11:04.780 --> 11:06.240
That must be him...

11:06.950 --> 11:09.500
The ancient dragon, Behemoth!

11:13.630 --> 11:16.000
I have never known defeat.

11:17.300 --> 11:20.340
Created by the Demon King,

11:20.340 --> 11:24.470
I have never encountered
anyone stronger than myself.

11:24.470 --> 11:28.220
I am a being born supreme.

11:28.820 --> 11:32.350
Born in a world without a single
threat to challenge me.

11:32.850 --> 11:36.020
Is there no worthy warrior
to match my strength?

11:36.860 --> 11:39.860
What an utterly...

11:42.030 --> 11:43.780
...dull world.

11:45.030 --> 11:47.620
He looks weak at first glance,

11:47.620 --> 11:50.460
but it seems he can cast
some decent magic.

11:50.460 --> 11:53.460
Not that magic would work on me.

11:54.380 --> 11:56.960
You, who dare stand against me.
Who are you?

11:57.440 --> 11:59.050
My name is Ein.

11:59.050 --> 12:01.220
I came to defeat you!

12:05.390 --> 12:07.140
How amusing!

12:07.140 --> 12:12.100
A fragile creature like you thinks
you can slay the mighty Behemoth?

12:12.940 --> 12:14.100
I do think so.

12:14.100 --> 12:16.560
That's why I'm here.

12:18.150 --> 12:20.530
I commend your bravado.

12:20.530 --> 12:24.160
However, it is the Demon King
himself who created me.

12:24.160 --> 12:27.660
A being born supreme. Also...

12:27.660 --> 12:31.500
Then I guess your so-called Demon King
wasn't all that strong, after all.

12:36.500 --> 12:40.760
How dare you, a mere human,
insult the Demon King?!

12:46.890 --> 12:49.220
Shoot as many as you want.
It's futile.

12:49.220 --> 12:51.810
Hmph. Do you really
think you can defeat me,

12:51.810 --> 12:54.390
the Earth King, in this sand?

12:54.390 --> 12:55.440
You mere human!

13:09.200 --> 13:13.410
But my hide is as tough
as orichalcum...

13:15.680 --> 13:19.920
Turns out, your defense isn't
that great after all.

13:20.670 --> 13:21.800
Then...

13:26.720 --> 13:29.220
What? Where did it go?

13:30.970 --> 13:33.680
Yes. Be panicked!
Tremble in fear!

13:33.680 --> 13:35.390
Tremble and despair!

13:36.640 --> 13:38.690
No matter how fast you are,

13:38.690 --> 13:41.650
if you can't see
where I'm attacking from,

13:41.650 --> 13:43.480
you can't possibly dodge it!

13:44.860 --> 13:50.120
The moment I resurface,
will be the moment your fate is sealed!

13:57.580 --> 13:59.880
I've devoured you, human!

13:59.880 --> 14:01.710
Hadn't you dared bare
your fangs at me,

14:01.710 --> 14:03.460
you might've lived a little long—

14:10.050 --> 14:13.180
W-What? What just happened?!

14:13.180 --> 14:16.180
P-Pain! This is pain...

14:16.180 --> 14:18.730
I've never felt anything
like this before!

14:26.240 --> 14:27.110
Those eyes...

14:28.200 --> 14:31.370
Those are not the eyes of prey...

14:31.370 --> 14:33.280
Those are the eyes of a predator...

14:34.370 --> 14:37.460
I see it now.

14:37.460 --> 14:39.460
This is my defeat.

14:41.790 --> 14:45.050
Human, what did you do?

14:45.050 --> 14:47.880
Why have I lost?

14:47.880 --> 14:51.930
I just fired a Grand Spell
from inside your body.

14:51.930 --> 14:56.350
My appraisal told me that only
your outer hide absorbs magic.

14:56.350 --> 15:01.150
But then, shouldn't you have been
caught in the explosion as well?

15:01.620 --> 15:05.440
Yeah, about that,
I used Barrier before I fired.

15:05.650 --> 15:07.610
I see...

15:07.610 --> 15:13.490
You didn't even notice the illusion
I cast on you when we first met, right?

15:14.160 --> 15:17.870
While you were underground,
until I dispelled it,

15:17.870 --> 15:20.620
you kept chasing after my mirage.

15:21.670 --> 15:25.380
I even taunted you
a lot to make you careless,

15:25.380 --> 15:28.380
but a strong being like you
should've known better.

15:28.380 --> 15:33.390
It is your arrogance toward humans
that brought you to your downfall.

15:35.140 --> 15:36.560
I see...

15:37.890 --> 15:40.890
I was already defeated
the moment we met.

15:41.390 --> 15:43.600
To think that you've
slayed this ancient dragon.

15:43.920 --> 15:45.810
You've outdone yourself, human.

15:47.230 --> 15:48.400
Or should I say...

15:49.190 --> 15:50.400
Ein.

15:51.110 --> 15:55.120
Pain, agony, fear, despair,

15:55.120 --> 16:00.410
humiliation, inferiority, regret,
and death.

16:01.410 --> 16:07.420
Were these terrifying things what
I had been seeking all along?

16:08.550 --> 16:10.420
The taste of defeat, huh...

16:10.420 --> 16:12.430
Not bad.

16:17.640 --> 16:19.470
What's wrong, kid?

16:19.470 --> 16:24.400
Nothing. Behemoth was indeed
a monster that attacked humans.

16:24.400 --> 16:28.730
But it's because the Demon King
made it that way.

16:28.730 --> 16:32.400
It makes me wonder what
that creature could've actually been.

16:33.450 --> 16:37.030
Just like how I could've been
hadn't I met Yuri and Ursula.

16:37.030 --> 16:40.750
Regardless of his origin,
it chose to attack humans.

16:40.750 --> 16:45.080
And it died without changing its ways.
Its essence remained the same.

16:45.080 --> 16:46.460
Essence, huh...

16:46.460 --> 16:49.590
Come on, hurry up
and appraise its abilities.

16:49.590 --> 16:50.800
O-Okay...

16:51.300 --> 16:52.240
(Magic Nullification Barrier (SS)
Completely blocks external magical attacks.)

16:52.240 --> 16:53.090
(Spiral Bullet (SS) Creates a vacuum
bullet that slices through space.)

16:53.090 --> 16:54.010
(Earth Manipulation (SS) Freely controls
and reshapes the ground and walls.)

16:54.010 --> 16:54.960
(Earth Dragon's Blessing (SS) Grants
strength and defense equal to Behemoth.)

16:54.960 --> 16:55.600
(Resistance · Dragon Attribute (SS)
Grants resistance

16:55.600 --> 16:56.300
(to physical and magical
attacks from dragon-type beings.)

16:56.300 --> 16:59.470
Amazing, Ein!

16:59.470 --> 17:02.730
You're so strong, Mister.

17:02.730 --> 17:07.520
Only the hero who sealed Miktoran
has ever slain an ancient dragon before.

17:07.520 --> 17:09.820
As expected of you, Einy.

17:10.130 --> 17:12.240
It's not that I'm strong.

17:12.240 --> 17:14.820
It's thanks to all of you
who gave me power.

17:16.030 --> 17:17.320
Thank you!

17:28.080 --> 17:29.590
Pardon me.

17:30.070 --> 17:32.260
Good day to you two.

17:32.260 --> 17:34.340
Good day to you too.

17:34.340 --> 17:38.890
My hero, I apologize for not
being able to see you sooner.

17:38.890 --> 17:41.430
Even though I am your second wife...

17:41.430 --> 17:43.350
No, we're not married!

17:44.230 --> 17:47.600
Anyway, the reason I
invited you here today is...

17:47.600 --> 17:50.190
...because my father wishes to meet you.

17:50.190 --> 17:51.480
Your father?

18:00.120 --> 18:02.870
His Majesty the King?!

18:02.870 --> 18:07.000
I-It's an honor to be
in your presence, Your Majesty.

18:07.000 --> 18:10.840
Me name is, I mean,
my name is Ein...

18:10.840 --> 18:13.880
Now, now.
You can take it easy, Ein.

18:16.380 --> 18:18.380
Allow me to sit beside you.

18:18.380 --> 18:20.260
M-Me too, as well!

18:20.260 --> 18:23.760
They're too close!
What is this situation?

18:23.760 --> 18:29.440
As a father-in-law, I'm so proud to see how
popular my daughter's future husband is.

18:30.100 --> 18:32.020
What do you think you're saying?!

18:33.070 --> 18:35.530
Oh no! I just blurted that out!

18:35.530 --> 18:38.780
Looks like you have
finally loosened up.

18:39.280 --> 18:41.160
My apologies.

18:41.160 --> 18:44.290
Thank you for responding
to my sudden summons.

18:44.290 --> 18:47.790
I truly wanted to meet you in person.

18:47.790 --> 18:51.630
First, regarding the ancient dragon
Behemoth's defeat.

18:51.630 --> 18:53.890
Meegan has informed me about it.

18:53.890 --> 18:56.630
As this nation's king,
I owe you my gratitude.

18:56.630 --> 18:58.170
It was a great deed you've done.

18:58.170 --> 19:00.800
P-Please. I merely did what I could.

19:02.350 --> 19:06.270
You are just as my
daughter described you.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.770
Huh? What did she say?

19:07.770 --> 19:09.810
If I must say, my hero.

19:09.810 --> 19:12.440
You are so strong! Handsome!

19:12.440 --> 19:17.690
Despite your incredible power,
you remain a humble gentleman.

19:17.690 --> 19:19.030
That's what I told him.

19:19.030 --> 19:20.820
Who's this perfect superhuman?

19:20.820 --> 19:23.320
It's not just about
the Behemoth incident.

19:23.320 --> 19:27.830
Allow me to also offer my proper gratitude
for saving my daughter the other day.

19:28.830 --> 19:30.080
Thank you!

19:30.080 --> 19:32.460
Oh, no...

19:32.460 --> 19:34.590
Please, raise your head.

19:34.590 --> 19:39.970
It is only natural for a father to bow
his head to his daughter's benefactor.

19:39.970 --> 19:43.510
T-Then please direct your gratitude
to Yuri instead.

19:44.010 --> 19:47.470
I wouldn't have been able to
do anything if it weren't for her help.

19:47.470 --> 19:51.640
Is that so? Then, thank you, Miss Yuri.

19:52.480 --> 19:56.480
Please pardon her.
She's a bit shy around people.

19:58.650 --> 20:03.490
I take pride in my ability
to be a good judge of character.

20:03.490 --> 20:08.290
You do not let power consume you,
and you have clear, honest eyes.

20:08.290 --> 20:10.500
I like that about you.

20:10.500 --> 20:14.130
Thank you very much.
I'm proud of these eyes, too.

20:15.000 --> 20:19.210
You will undoubtedly become
a great figure in the future.

20:20.260 --> 20:23.380
I look forward to watching you grow.

20:25.260 --> 20:28.100
Well then, it's about time.

20:28.100 --> 20:32.480
Talking with you has been
so enjoyable that I lost track of time.

20:32.480 --> 20:34.270
Ah, that's right.

20:35.270 --> 20:37.020
Here, take this.

20:37.020 --> 20:38.320
What is this?

20:38.320 --> 20:41.030
A watch bearing the royal emblem.

20:41.030 --> 20:45.070
With this, you will have
unrestricted access anywhere.

20:45.070 --> 20:47.870
Use it to achieve your goals.

20:47.870 --> 20:50.580
You're giving me such an important item?

20:51.670 --> 20:56.250
If I have this, I'll be able to access
places I couldn't before.

20:56.250 --> 20:59.590
It will surely aid me
in finding Yuri's family.

21:01.260 --> 21:03.220
I will treasure it!

21:04.300 --> 21:07.300
Well then, see you later, Ein.

21:07.890 --> 21:10.890
Did you hear the story about
the Behemoth being defeated?

21:10.890 --> 21:12.680
Who in the world are they?

21:12.680 --> 21:16.440
They said it was Ein
the appraiser who did it.

21:16.440 --> 21:19.690
Ein? You mean the guy who
cleared the hidden dungeon?!

21:22.940 --> 21:25.740
Dude, that's dangerous!

21:25.740 --> 21:29.620
Rubbish should just stay
in the gutter where it belongs.

21:30.450 --> 21:32.830
Everyone, here and there.

21:32.830 --> 21:35.620
All they yap about is Ein,
over and over.

21:36.460 --> 21:40.590
Not too long ago,
I was stronger than him.

21:41.210 --> 21:46.340
He should've just stayed behind me,
picking up rubbish like always...

21:47.220 --> 21:50.220
If only he weren't around...

21:50.220 --> 21:54.230
If you'd like to,
I can lend you my strength.

21:58.980 --> 22:02.020
My name is Echidna.

22:02.020 --> 22:04.240
I am a spirit.

22:09.620 --> 22:14.950
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.950 --> 22:19.960
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.960 --> 22:22.380
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.380 --> 22:25.460
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.470 --> 22:30.430
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.430 --> 22:37.180
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.180 --> 22:42.060
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.060 --> 22:47.070
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.070 --> 22:51.870
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.160 --> 22:55.620
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.620 --> 22:57.080
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.080 --> 23:03.960
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.840 --> 23:11.260
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.260 --> 23:15.930
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.930 --> 23:18.600
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.600 --> 23:21.190
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.190 --> 23:26.110
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.110 --> 23:28.530
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.530 --> 23:31.070
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.070 --> 23:31.700
(Even Given)

23:31.700 --> 23:32.280
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.280 --> 23:32.490
(I'm)

23:32.490 --> 23:32.660
(Actually)

23:32.660 --> 23:32.780
(the Strongest)

23:35.660 --> 23:38.580
Next Episode: VS. Zoid.

23:38.580 --> 23:40.580
(Next Episode: VS. Zoid)
